	"data": "Godot XR Tools\n\nThe core interaction toolkit for XR in Godot. This is the floor you build on.\nRepo: <https://github.com/GodotVR/godot-xr-tools>\nLicense: MIT\nGodot version: 4.x (works with 4.6+)\nStatus: Actively maintained, official GodotVR org\n\nWhat It Provides\nLocomotion (teleport, smooth movement, climb)\nObject interaction (grab, release, snap points, SnapPath)\nPointer-hosted scenes (ray-based interaction)\nViewport2Din3D — render 2D content as panels in 3D space\nPickable objects with…",
